        "pf_8e73ce8d_value": "UraGuard® is designed with women’s health in mind. Unlike standard incontinence products, Athena features patent-pending UraGuard® technology—a discreet shield that helps reduce exposure to bacteria trapped within the product. By blocking bacteria from reaching the urethral area, UraGuard® adds an extra layer of protection where it matters most.",
        "pf_3251d064_value": "Currently, UraGuard® is available as a shield insert allowing you to add our anti-bacterial protective benefits to any existing incontinence product. However, we understand the need for an all-in-one solution, and we are actively exploring pull-up and tabbed-style options. Stay tuned for updates!",
        "pf_3d7baefe_value": "No. UraGuard is a thin barrier shield — not an additional absorbency layer. Moisture passes through into your incontinence product as normal. The difference is that there is now a physical barrier between that product and your skin, blocking bacterial contact at the urethral area.",
        "pf_59275c48_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(25, 52, 69);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 52, 69);\"><b>Most Incontinence Products Prevent Leaks,&nbsp;<br><span style=\"color: rgb(42, 125, 150);\">But Not Bacteria Exposure &amp; Moisture.</span></b></span><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 52, 69);\"></span>",
        "pf_70824ea9_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(25, 52, 69);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 52, 69);\"><b>Most Incontinence Products Prevent Leaks,&nbsp;<br><span style=\"color: rgb(42, 125, 150);\">But Not Bacteria Exposure &amp; Moisture.</span></b></span><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 52, 69);\"></span>",
        "pf_5af0ada9_value": "Replace UraGuard®&nbsp;whenever you change your incontinence product. Each shield is designed for single-session use. Lab testing confirms it maintains its protective barrier for 8+ hours, so for most women this means two to four shields per day depending on your routine.",
        "pf_658ba874_value": "<strong></strong>UraGuard® is the only daily shield built to address bacterial contact from incontinence products.&nbsp;<br><br><span style=\"color: rgb(42, 125, 150);\">If you are not satisfied with the product, we offer an exchange or refund. No hassle.</span>",
        "pf_9e24cca6_value": "You can buy UraGuard as a one-time purchase or subscribe to save. If you subscribe: billing is monthly, you can cancel before your next charge with no penalty, and there are no hidden fees. All terms are shown clearly at checkout before you confirm.",
        "pf_fa8cb726_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(25, 52, 69);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 52, 69);\"><b>Try It For 30 Days.<br><span style=\"color: rgb(42, 125, 150);\">On Us, If It Does Not Work.</span></b></span><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 52, 69);\"></span>",
        "pf_40dcdf62_value": "UraGuard® is designed to stay in place throughout the day. Its thin, flexible, contoured construction moves with your body. It is skin-safe and discreet. In fact, most users report forgetting it is there within the first week of use.",
        "pf_6df12baf_value": "UraGuard® inserts into your existing incontinence product and <strong>sits between it</strong> and the <strong>urethra.</strong> Bacteria <b>s</b><strong>tays in the product </strong>— safeguarding where it matters most.",
        "pf_06b0af46_value": "UraGuard® is proudly manufactured in the USA. We are committed to high-quality manufacturing standards to ensure our products meet the needs of women seeking comfort, protection, and urinary health support.",
        "pf_2d2ae136_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(26, 74, 90);\"><b>The First</b> <span style=\"color: rgb(42, 125, 150);\"><strong style=\"\">Daily Shield</strong></span> <b>Against</b> <b>Bacteria and Moisture</b></span>",
        "pf_14c569ad_value": "All incontinence products<b> trap moisture </b>—&nbsp;creating a breeding ground for <b>bacteria</b>. The longer you wear them, the higher the <b>risk of&nbsp;infection and UTIs</b>.&nbsp;",
        "pf_a1380d8f_value": "All incontinence products<b> trap moisture </b>—&nbsp;creating a breeding ground for <b>bacteria</b>. The longer you wear them, the higher the <b>risk of&nbsp;infection and UTIs</b>.&nbsp;",
        "pf_e9ed7e7d_value": "UraGuard® inserts into your existing incontinence product and <b>sits between it </b>and <b>the urethra</b>. Bacteria <b>stays in the product</b> — safeguarding where it matters most.",
        "pf_295bfa4b_value": "UraGuard works your existing incontinence product. There is nothing new to learn,&nbsp;just an extra layer of protection placed exactly where bacteria are most likely to cause harm.",
        "pf_58236786_value": "UraGuard works your existing incontinence product. There is nothing new to learn,&nbsp;just an extra layer of protection placed exactly where bacteria are most likely to cause harm.",
        "pf_c6c8618f_value": "Your incontinence product traps bacteria against your skin. The UraGuard® liner creates a protective barrier — so you don't have to choose between comfort and your health.",
        "pf_9c5288a7_value": "Ensure the <b>blue rectangle is facing up</b> and is pointing to you. <b>Place the shield </b>directly where urine exits the body.",
        "pf_58d7295b_value": "<b style=\"\"><font color=\"#193445\">Four Steps to Daily Protection.</font></b><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 52, 69);\"></span>",
        "pf_8fccb0bd_value": "<b style=\"\"><font color=\"#193445\">Four Steps to Daily Protection.</font></b><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 52, 69);\"></span>",
        "pf_38e30ecb_value": "<em>“It has a great design. Very soft, easy to put on, and it stays on. Would definitely recommend this product.”</em>",
        "pf_95bcba40_value": "<em>\"It helps keep moisture away and prevents bacteria from forming. I do have that peace of mind when using it.”</em>",
        "pf_cbb6beda_value": "<em>“I believe this is going to be a good fit with my mom to decrease the chance of her getting another UTI”</em>",
